{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 2, "text": "《转场经》是在古谢过程中走转场时念唱的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 286, "y": 531, "w": 784, "h": 46}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《转场经》是在古谢过程中走转场时念唱的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 286, "y": 531, "w": 784, "h": 46}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 3, "text": "转场又名走场，是古谢中最隆重的一种礼仪。孝男们披麻带孝，孝", "bbox_px": {"x": 273, "y": 590, "w": 1132, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "转场又名走场，是古谢中最隆重的一种礼仪。孝男们披麻带孝，孝", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 273, "y": 590, "w": 1132, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 4, "text": "女们身着古朴庄重的民族服装，披着饭笼，带着孝帕。由经师带着他", "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 649, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "女们身着古朴庄重的民族服装，披着饭笼，带着孝帕。由经师带着他", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 649, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 5, "text": "们围着固定的场地转，围着魂竿转，也围着祭牛转，边转经师边唱。", "bbox_px": {"x": 191, "y": 709, "w": 1198, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "们围着固定的场地转，围着魂竿转，也围着祭牛转，边转经师边唱。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 191, "y": 709, "w": 1198, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 6, "text": "经师打神刀在前，唱得很神气。是古谢中最风趣也最有民族特色的风", "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 768, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经师打神刀在前，唱得很神气。是古谢中最风趣也最有民族特色的风", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 768, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 7, "text": "俗。内容有祈祷亡灵升天，追述民族历史、陈述民族风规等等。可高", "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 831, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "俗。内容有祈祷亡灵升天，追述民族历史、陈述民族风规等等。可高", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 831, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 8, "text": "声吟唱，与密咒经的唱法绝然不同。", "bbox_px": {"x": 191, "y": 890, "w": 632, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "声吟唱，与密咒经的唱法绝然不同。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 191, "y": 890, "w": 632, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 9, "text": "转场经由十几段经词组成，每唱完一段转场一圈，每段之间有共", "bbox_px": {"x": 273, "y": 953, "w": 1126, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "转场经由十几段经词组成，每唱完一段转场一圈，每段之间有共", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 273, "y": 953, "w": 1126, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 10, "text": "同的七句过疲词，意即这首唱完了，接唱下一首。这十几段经词中，", "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 1012, "w": 1188, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "同的七句过疲词，意即这首唱完了，接唱下一首。这十几段经词中，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 1012, "w": 1188, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 11, "text": "有灵房歌（构菜）、门歌（构兜）、放魂歌（仲欢）、梯坎歌（构", "bbox_px": {"x": 191, "y": 1071, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "有灵房歌（构菜）、门歌（构兜）、放魂歌（仲欢）、梯坎歌（构", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 191, "y": 1071, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 12, "text": "味）、唤山神歌（坝兜埃止）、坟地歌（构地）、调脸歌（那外）、", "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 1134, "w": 1192, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "味）、唤山神歌（坝兜埃止）、坟地歌（构地）、调脸歌（那外）、", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 194, "y": 1134, "w": 1192, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
