{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 204, "line_no": 16, "text": "经词，除陈述一定的礼仪、习俗外，更多的是追述了祖先创业之艰", "bbox_px": {"x": 188, "y": 1375, "w": 1208, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经词，除陈述一定的礼仪、习俗外，更多的是追述了祖先创业之艰", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 188, "y": 1375, "w": 1208, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
